[6.475,"o","\u001b[36m🏛️  RuleOfCode v7.29.1 — constitutional audit\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[93m🎯 ALLOWLIST — only the laws named in laws.enabled will run.\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[33m   Unless it names every applicable law, this cannot produce a compliance verdict.\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[33m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[94m🔍 Starting constitutional audit...\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[90mProject:\u001b[39m d:\\tmp\\demo-app\r\n\u001b[90mMode:\u001b[39m full\r\n\u001b[90mProject type:\u001b[39m typescript (detected)\r\n\u001b[33m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[33m⚠️  Warning: Missing git hooks: All hooks - .husky directory not found\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[90m   Run 'npx ruleofcode reinstall-hooks' to install them\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\u001b[33m⚖️  Executing constitutional checks...\u001b[39m\r\n🔍 Processing 6 laws (parallel: true)\r\n\r\n\r\n\u001b[36m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[37m   🏛️  CONSTITUTIONAL AUDIT RESULTS\u001b[39m\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[36m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1m📊 AUDIT SUMMARY:\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\n"]
